      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Lean models a machine by a recursively enumerable arithmetic axiom set, and production by derivability. It also fixes IΣ₁ as a sufficient lower bound on the first machine’s deductive strength. Lucas does not specify a machine representation or an exact arithmetic base."
